OL,3,AHouthis claim major advance in Yemen as
OL,4,Agroup reportedly seizes island in key
OL,5,Ashipping route
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe group also claims it has expelled
OL,8,F"Saudi-backed forces" from Yemen's
OL,9,Fwestern coast
OL,11,FSaudi Arabia has relied on the Red Sea
OL,12,Ffor oil exports since the US and
OL,13,FIsrael's war effectively closed the
OL,14,FStrait of Hormuz
OL,16,FAt least 46,000 people have been
OL,17,Fdisplaced in Yemen since fighting
OL,18,Fescalated last week, according to the
OL,19,FInternational Organization for
OL,20,FMigration
